{"id":"kern","parentId":null,"showOnRoot":false,"layout":"folder","windowWidth":"748px","windowHeight":"506px","textWidth":"62ch","body":"","showOverview":true,"showFolderActions":true,"blocks":[{"id":"kern-hero","type":"video","width":"full","heading":"Current prototype","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/KERN/prototype/kern_gameplay_test.mp4","mediaRef":"media-kern-prototype-kern-gameplay-test-mp4","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"Kern Gameplay Test portfolio artifact","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"assets/media/posters/media-kern-prototype-kern-gameplay-test-mp4.jpg","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"kern-journey","type":"text","width":"full","heading":"Designing the investigation","body":"KERN is in development. My focus is how a player investigates an unfamiliar anomaly: observing its behavior, testing an explanation, and choosing what to do next.\n\nI design and prototype gameplay systems, tools, and interfaces directly in-engine, iterating interaction details through hands-on use. The mechanics and world identity are developed together so the fiction supports the investigation. The footage shows prototypes and experiments, not a finished game.","source":"","mediaRef":"","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"","fit":"cover"},{"id":"kern-sound","type":"video","width":"half","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/KERN/prototype/kern_event_sound_test.mp4","mediaRef":"media-kern-prototype-kern-event-sound-test-mp4","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"Kern Event Sound Test portfolio artifact","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"assets/media/posters/media-kern-prototype-kern-event-sound-test-mp4.jpg","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"kern-sketch","type":"image","width":"half","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/KERN/prototype/FotoSketcher_image6.webp","mediaRef":"media-kern-prototype-fotosketcher-image6-png","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"FotoSketcher Image6 portfolio artifact","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"kern-question","type":"text","width":"full","heading":"Evidence, not checklists","body":"The design goal is for tools to reveal evidence the player can interpret. An encounter should preserve uncertainty and risk, while an explanation should lead to an action rather than only a label.","source":"","mediaRef":"","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"","fit":"cover"},{"id":"kern-study-1","type":"image","width":"third","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/KERN/prototype/FotoSketcher_image.webp","mediaRef":"media-kern-prototype-fotosketcher-image-png","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"FotoSketcher Image portfolio artifact","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"kern-study-2","type":"image","width":"third","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/KERN/prototype/FotoSketcher_image2.webp","mediaRef":"media-kern-prototype-fotosketcher-image2-png","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"FotoSketcher Image2 portfolio artifact","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"kern-study-3","type":"image","width":"third","heading":"","body":"","source":"assets/media/optimized/Projects/KERN/prototype/FotoSketcher_image3.webp","mediaRef":"media-kern-prototype-fotosketcher-image3-png","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"FotoSketcher Image3 portfolio artifact","fit":"cover","posterFrame":"","mediaWidth":0,"mediaHeight":0,"aspectRatio":""},{"id":"kern-identity","type":"text","width":"full","heading":"An institution inside the world","body":"The identity belongs to an organization operating inside the Zone. Its graphics are part of the setting and the way the player encounters information.","source":"","mediaRef":"","href":"","label":"","projectId":"","alt":"","fit":"cover"},{"id":"kern-b